    "name": "Camera lab (sysid 31 / 14570)",
    "info": "Dedicated Copter-4.7.0 SITL sysid 31 with --gimbal + servo mount and CAM1_TYPE=1.\nConnection: bind 0.0.0.0:14570 → remote 127.0.0.1:14571.\n\nMeasured firmware behaviour (confirm delivery, COMMAND_LONG):\n- camera photo (IMAGE_START_CAPTURE) → COMMAND_ACK result 0 (ACCEPTED) — expect succeeded\n- camera start-video (VIDEO_START_CAPTURE) → COMMAND_ACK result 4 (DENIED) — expect denied/failed\n- camera stop-video (VIDEO_STOP_CAPTURE) → COMMAND_ACK result 4 (DENIED) — expect denied/failed\n\nVideo DENIED is honest firmware behaviour on this SITL camera, not a harness failure.\nHarness fires all three injects; verdict debug names: photo status, video start status, video stop status.",
